Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:05.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（竹芋）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:09.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荸荠）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 卡萝尔 - 托宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Carol. - Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该吃点饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 孩子们还饿着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not with the kids as hungry…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 有很多 我找到了很多橡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's plenty. I foraged a lot of acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是粉色的 - 甜菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're pink. - Beets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甜菜 - 能让它们更甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beets? - It's what makes them sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不大喜欢吃甜菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never was much of a beet kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别废话了直接吃行吗 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you just put it in your mouth, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我吃过的最好吃的甜菜橡子饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the best beet and acorn cookies I've ever eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在耍我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you screwing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她该登记我们带回来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should inventory what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫她在储藏室见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet her at the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们弄到了食物吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have food? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够再撑一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough for another month.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫大家一小时内到教堂集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need everybody in the church in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一会儿说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事过后有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Since what? - Since we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那牢房里只聊天了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we did in that cell? We talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 罗西塔 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, Rosita, Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么没有说 - 我叫他们保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't they…? - I told them to keep quiet about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能忘了这事 翻篇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just forget it, move past it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要背负那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to carry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to tell anyone, it…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你也做了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like you did it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:41.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山姆·安德森）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:16.52,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以跟山顶寨合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can work with the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬谈定了一笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie hammered out a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为我们提供食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting food…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡蛋 黄油 新鲜蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggs, butter, fresh vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不是白送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not just giving it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点在路上杀了萨沙 达里尔和亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}they almost killed Sasha, Daryl, and Abraham on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们迟早会找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sooner or later, they would've found us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟狼群一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like those Wolves did,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟耶稣一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Jesus did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀死我们中的一个或几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would killed someone or some of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们会试图支配我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they would try to own us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们会试图阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we would try to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但到了那个时候 在那种战斗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But by then, in that kind of fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们粮食短缺 可能会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}low on food, we could lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一一种能尽可能地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way to be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保我们取胜的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}as sure as we can get, that we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有帮山顶寨这个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do this for the Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能保护这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's how we keep this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能养活这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how we feed this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事得集体表决\N{\fnArial\fs30}This needs to be a group decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有人反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anybody objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是你们发表意见的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's your chance to say your piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们能取胜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure we can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以打败他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭借我们做过的事 我们学到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What this group has done, what we've learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所成为的人 我们所有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we've become, all of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们只用告诉他们这一点就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then all we have to do is just tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是不会妥协的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they don't compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是要他们妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给他们一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a choice you give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一条出路 对他们和对我们都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a way out, for them and for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我们试着去和救世军谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try and talk to the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就放弃了我们的先机和安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}we give up our advantage, our safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们得在他们找上门之前抢先出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we have to come for them before they come for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他们活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有生命 便有可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's life, there's possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有他们攻击我们的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of them hitting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not trapped in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有一个人必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you are trapped in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They always come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.98,0:08:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死后也会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back when they're dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 到时我们会阻止它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前就阻止过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根想要先和他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan wants to talk to them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that would be a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不取决于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和那些待在家中的人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to the people still at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会和现在正在放哨的人讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll discuss it with the people on guard now, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里还有没有人想要先和救世军接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}but who else wants to approach the Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk to them first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方发生过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让它再次发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we won't let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很清楚这是怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know exactly what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不回避它 才能生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't shy from it, we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把他们杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都得动手杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't all have to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但选择留在这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if people are gonna stay here…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须接受这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}they do have to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瑞恩 凯伦 大卫 丽兹）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点站/院子 3）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:19.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜡烛女 4）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:23.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（狼群 7）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:30.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（共计18）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要有人在周边放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need someone on the perimeter keeping watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再安全也不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever safer looks like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易是我谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made that deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不是我的主意 但却牵连了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my idea, but I led us into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西会要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多余的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.02,0:11:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你的份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也睡不着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't sleep either?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候睡着过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never could sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心明天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worried about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做出的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do things that…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把我吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just terrify me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我为什么做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think I do those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是位母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… it…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说饼干和微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the cookies or the smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,棘手的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the hard stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大多数人的心中 你是位母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mom to most of the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:12:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你心中也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我心中很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're something else to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没到明天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not tomorrow yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开始收拾了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Packing your stilettos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只离开一个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll only be gone a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去 但是明天才去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, too, but tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当真要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我所希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 为什么红果莓是棕色的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Why are dingleberries brown?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有那么多狗屁理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the way shit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我们经历了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. After everything we've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许一走了之 除非告诉我理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not walking out that door unless you can tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次见到你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first met you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是地球上最后一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the last woman on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尝过这个吗 很有嚼头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try one of these? They're chewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,劲道\N{\fnArial\fs30}got some fight in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,描述一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.37,0:15:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,长方形的建筑 顶部有个大接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rectangular building, big satellites on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有窗户吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember any.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们只给那地方留了一个入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they made it so there's only one way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,门口有守卫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 至少两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, two of them, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道他们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't know how many people they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我看到过一个储存食物的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no. I saw a place where they stored food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面不大 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't that big, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你进去过吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been inside? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.09,0:15:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我们搬过一次补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had us load in supplies one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不担心 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 走之前我想说出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, and I just wanted to say it before…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用回应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to say it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个… - 等你回来我再回应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's… - I'll say it when you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希斯和我还得再出去两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath and I are still going on that two-weeker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就从那里出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna leave from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想一起走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以改计划 不用从基地走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can change it so we don't leave from the compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以回来 从这里走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could come back and we could leave from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要拿些药品 所以… - 我不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, we're gonna get meds, so… - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得留在这 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I didn't… I'm… I just… I need to be here. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我是唯一的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only doctor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你回来我会回应你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you when you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到其他房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't see any other rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 地方很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我看到的那条走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the hallway I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次他们都让你们把东西搬到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every time, they had you bring things into here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带过一些长矛给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought a couple spears for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个救世军沿着这条走廊把东西带进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of the Saviors took them down this hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定是做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they must've done something with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们没把东西带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they didn't come back with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是个武器柜 军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a weapons locker, an armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去 守住军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in there, secure the armory,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能终结战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's how we end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时卡萝尔在这里也是这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how Carol ended it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们是否有军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't know if they have an armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至在哪我们都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}or where it even is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多可靠的推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've got a lot of good guesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠更少的情报我们都成功过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done more with less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们晚上趁他们睡觉时潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in at night while they're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫不会睡觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guards won't be sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我说 我认为只有一条路进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, I think there's only one way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法在不吵醒其他人的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's no way to bust through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接从那扇门突入\N{\fnArial\fs30}without waking up the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用吵醒他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会开门让我们进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to open it for us, let us walk right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要格雷戈里的人头 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want Gregory's head, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.34,0:18:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从这开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每四分之一英里就分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll peel off every quarter mile,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后来这会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet back here in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有什么收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没法回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能跑一小段 也许能跑很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe run a little, maybe a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想学习 你教我是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to learn and you taught me for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么还穿成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you still wearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 我还是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still who I was. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们很难在黑暗中看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'll be harder for them to see me in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点就在会上跟大家说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost told everyone at the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not telling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根在教堂里站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan stood up in that church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图说服我们不要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to talk us out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他不知道他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that he didn't know what the hell he's talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没把他藏匿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he should take the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个精神病的事抖出来 他就应该知足\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we didn't kick his ass out for hiding that psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们跟所有人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we told everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会知道丹妮斯的事 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd find out about Denise, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个婊子养的想站在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hijo de puta tried to stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现得好像我们不知道我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and act like we didn't know what we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不想杀人 也不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to kill. We don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就这样发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟人说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们剪一下头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we, um, cut the hair…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:20:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,修一下胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}trim the beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要杀了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna kill those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've been lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前都没必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had to do it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一直很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been lucky, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你紧张吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历过那种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever seen something that, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历过之后 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}afterwards, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不饿 因为当你闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you weren't hungry because when you close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会浮现在眼前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当你试图去吃东西… - 有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And when you try to eat… - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人肯定比这感觉糟多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing somebody has gotta be worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这一切 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the whole thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这一切都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去四周看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take a look around,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸清楚那里到底有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to get a feel for how many people are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们觉得可行 就潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like how it looks, we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明前的那几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of hours before dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的守卫也倦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guards outside'll be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的人都在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone inside'll be sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.75,0:22:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果感觉形势不对就撤退 重订计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't like what we see, we head back, make a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:22:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让耶稣躲在暗处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep Jesus in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的生存方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的生存方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们半夜出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We roll out at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬怎么也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is Maggie here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她负责在周边放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's guarding the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但她为什么会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是她的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it's her choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟她一起待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to stay out there with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须率先夺取军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this whole thing's a race to the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要尽可能多的人一起进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need as many people inside as we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.57,0:23:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不该一个人在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shouldn't be out there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一开始就不该来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shouldn't be out here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把头发弄好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done with the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What've we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.95,0:24:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个 - 就那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That one. - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.70,0:24:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们是晚上行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though, it's probably good we're doing this at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻子 格雷戈里的鼻子形状不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nose. Gregory's is a different shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.43,0:24:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他反抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打断了你的手 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke your hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没必要追究细节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess there's no reason to be subtle about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.97,0:24:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军很可怕 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors, they're scary, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮混球跟你比差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}those pricks got nothing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.90,0:25:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上名来 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Announce yourself, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是山顶寨的埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Eddie from Hilltop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务已完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.99,0:25:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.68,0:25:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他的头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.51,0:25:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it here, shit brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.35,0:25:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从袋子里拿出来 小牙签\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want the bag, needle dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这狗东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look at this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.58,0:26:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这狗东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look at this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.95,0:26:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打断了我的手 我打断了他的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke my hand. I broke his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他看起来是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.29,0:27:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贱人打断了我的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little bitch broke my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看来你长教训了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, looks like you learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.13,0:27:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放了你的人 你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get your guy, you'll go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.27,0:27:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周多带点贡品过来 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you bring us more stuff next week, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.88,0:28:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well. Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你回家 带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bringing you back. We're bringing you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.40,0:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查门 找到军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the doors. Find the arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.15,0:28:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.06,0:32:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是神父吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克和卡尔教我用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and Carl taught me about guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}other weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.02,0:32:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我怎么出一份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.14,0:32:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我对我女朋友撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to my girlfriend this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 她发现我在想事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um… she caught me thinking about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.96,0:32:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我告诉她我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I told her that I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.35,0:32:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次对她这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么对她说是为了隐瞒一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I told her, covering something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:33:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在隐瞒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you covering?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.20,0:33:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前做过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'd done something like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.72,0:33:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.88,0:33:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.07,0:33:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.08,0:33:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道自己是为什么而战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know what you're fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.05,0:33:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏宝室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honeypot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.33,0:34:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有麻烦了 待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in trouble. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.79,0:34:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一块去 - 我说了待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going with you. - I said stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.40,0:34:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.70,0:34:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须去 - 不 你不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to. - No, you don't. You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.06,0:34:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.15,0:34:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底来这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.37,0:34:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我应该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.42,0:34:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该做个母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.17,0:34:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.80,0:34:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.27,0:35:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 送他们回山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go. Get them back to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.15,0:35:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你们的人可能有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Your people could be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.09,0:35:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你带他们回去 交易依然有效 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get them back, the deal's still on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.69,0:35:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能自己回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they get themselves back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.93,0:35:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 送他们回山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, drive him back to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果他们看到你 而我们没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if they see you and we don't make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.16,0:35:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功的 他们不会看到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it. And they're not gonna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.26,0:35:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.76,0:35:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.87,0:36:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们死 就是你们亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't us, it was gonna be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.91,0:36:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.37,0:36:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是上锁的房间之一 我掩护你 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of the locked ones. I'm gonna cover you. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.71,0:36:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.90,0:38:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.85,0:38:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.86,0:38:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.09,0:38:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀我吗 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill me, Padre?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Padre?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.31,0:38:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们心里不要忧愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let not your heart be troubled."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.77,0:38:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我一样死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just as dead as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.54,0:38:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我父的家里 有许多住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In my father's house are many mansions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.01,0:38:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是没有 我就早已告诉你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were not so, I would've told you."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.38,0:38:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.37,0:38:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我若去为你们预备了地方 - 要见血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "I go prepare a place for you." - Blood's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.05,0:39:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.36,0:39:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我们回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to just come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.44,0:39:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息几天 再和塔拉出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a couple days before you and Tara go out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了老兄 我只想尽快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. I just want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.08,0:41:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.58,0:41:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.77,0:41:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想知道他们中哪个是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to know which one of them was Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.77,0:41:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.05,0:41:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从哪里搞到摩托的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get the bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.57,0:41:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.87,0:41:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你们杀了其他人一样 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you did everyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.47,0:41:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your gun, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.94,0:41:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着柯尔特蟒蛇左轮的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, with the Colt Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.03,0:41:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所有人 立刻放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you, lower your weapons right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.67,0:41:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.52,0:41:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.89,0:42:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会出来 但我们会谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not coming out, but we will talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.95,0:42:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔和玛姬在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a Carol and a Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.43,0:42:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们应该想谈谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking that's something you want to chat about.
